{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "47eef43475b65522e2fd6251e6c6cd6c8104ca0750175ad5aa97a75fee72d639", "ja": "……しゅたたたっ♪\nとうっ！　レイカ、着艦で～す！", "zh": "……唰唰唰♪\n嘿！丽花，着舰啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1001_p", "source_sha256": "851a8b9fc7ac0d2c00699aa2aba81cfe3fdaa8b053c03abadb1237d5048b7c62", "ja": "はは、楽しそうだな、麗花。\n新しい衣装、気に入ってもらえてよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，看起来很开心啊，丽花。\n你喜欢这套新服装，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "d54d4f2c4a07fe31bc28bb21cc336ab0a130c54b39b5e31911f3f81b1bf4f4fa", "ja": "はい！　新型アーマーさん、かっこよくて素敵ですね♪\n本当に空も飛べそうです。びゅんびゅんびゅーん♪", "zh": "是的！这套新型装甲又帅气又漂亮呢♪\n感觉真的能飞上天。嗖嗖嗖——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "4682efb4c9acdcd9cfc926d185ba148b8862a845e904446aa5cfcf88e3989674", "ja": "もしかしたら、どこかに飛行スイッチがあるかもって\n探してみたんですけど、ありませんでした。", "zh": "我还以为说不定哪里会有飞行开关，就找了一下，结果没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ce3ff73facc10b77f6047a8f4373f6c72e22f9f5f19df8257e9aec933ddb0bf0", "ja": "あくまで衣装だから……。まあ、いつか本当に\n空を飛ぶことができる衣装が作れたらいいんだけど。", "zh": "毕竟只是演出服……不过，要是有一天能做出真的可以飞上天空的服装就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "195ddc7738e698e9ff88325d6bf1c00f0cd6ad740a396dd9bd4beacbd967fb99", "ja": "わあ、それってすごく未来系ですね！\nはいはいはーい、私、一番に空を飛びたいです！", "zh": "哇，那可太有未来感了！\n好耶好耶——我想第一个在天上飞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "e74667ed515b48484e8fb38af1c65c4e045a7db158a7f6542fc088ba64787c00", "ja": "あっ、でも、本当にそんな衣装があったら、\n美咲さんが整備に追われて大変ですよね……？", "zh": "啊，不过，要是真的有那种服装，\n美咲小姐就得忙着维护它了，会很辛苦吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1007_p", "source_sha256": "989362ad072a3f46b2ee2d467b28559e780e441b832ceeae4292804e738c0760", "ja": "そ、そうだな……というか、そうなったらもう衣装じゃ\nなくて装備だから、別に整備士さんが必要だと思うよ。", "zh": "没、没错……或者说，要真那样的话，那就不是服装而是装备了，我觉得还得另外请一位维修师才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "3dc529d0afce9d1550738d671286ebd0bac66d86e863be50b7c536eac06ed666", "ja": "なるほどなるほど。 {$P$}さんが\n整備デューサーさんになるんですね？　さすがです♪", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此。也就是说，{$P$}先生要成为维修制作人了吧？真不愧是您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1b986def2bee609e045a13e48448a1631ca8425263bd75c2c741518b588b56f5", "ja": "えっ？　俺？", "zh": "诶？我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "7e42a4bfa1609266b3e5f6cf455ff899ee4dd12aa068ff3f6a8157b210d9415e", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、メカやロボットが\n大好きみたいですから、適材適所のナイスな配置です！", "zh": "{$P$}先生好像很喜欢机械和机器人，\n这可是人尽其才的绝妙安排哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "988088f3bb2f0767b63444c80f2003597fa72126e2e88f8515daeccd4d80df23", "ja": "大好き……かどうかはともかく、だとしても\n機械のメンテナンスは、また別の話というか……。", "zh": "喜不喜欢……暂且不论，就算真喜欢，\n保养机械也完全是另一码事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "22dc88687d69e3ce1866e54b429ee4e5aaa17c236079da7631a7ba85f2bb07f4", "ja": "そこを何とか！　私は{$P$}さんが\nメンテナンスしてくれるからこそ、飛べるんですよ？", "zh": "拜托了，就想想办法嘛！正因为有{$P$}先生帮我做维护，我才能飞起来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1013_p", "source_sha256": "53bab9dd6eb4423f59a6952fbcc363818a62835456bf66a0447dc6c48254ebd6", "ja": "そ、そこまで言うなら……正直、自信はないけど、\nもし、その時がきたらやってみようか。", "zh": "既、既然你都说到这个份上了……老实说我没什么自信，不过，如果那时候真的到了，我就试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "d8574063d0ec6c0bf83a68a7889c2f2a033a0d14e775d3f705732cf5ab09ad6e", "ja": "わーいわーい！　ありがとうございます♪\n約束ですよ！　覚えていてくださいね？", "zh": "好耶好耶！谢谢您♪\n约好了哦！要记得呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1015_p", "source_sha256": "582fd2b19ecead2b7600d0094eef1a34ae915d3a92e4e359c69f4834b9e58e38", "ja": "わかった。まあ、アーマーみたいな衣装で\n空を飛べる日は、ずっと未来の話だろうけど。", "zh": "知道了。不过，要穿着像装甲一样的服装飞上天空，还得是很久以后的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "3e7303dd2efa62c5fb4791062b477a4dbf7c5a1537ee8fbaf887734658d821c0", "ja": "ふふっ、それなら私はずっと未来になるまで！\n{$P$}さんと一緒にいます♪", "zh": "呵呵，那样的话，在遥远的未来到来之前，我都会和{$P$}先生在一起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0584_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e756e9660271d2a7602ee8222a0a7b021a21bdbc152700d2e64ee56464ab9df4", "ja": "（空を飛ぶ日を夢見て、麗花は無邪気に喜んでいる。\nいつかの未来まで、約束を忘れないようにしないとな）", "zh": "（丽花正做着飞上天空的梦，天真地开心着。\n可不能忘记约定，要一直记到未来的某一天才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
